@@ -0,0 +1,156 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
+/*
+ *  horizon-prism - Prism Launcher fork for Project Horizon
+ *  Copyright (C) 2026 horizon-prism contributors
+ *
